<text x="454.66" y="213.36" size="1.778" layer="97" rot="R180" align="bottom-center">USB-C Back
Current Protection</text>
<text x="515.62" y="556.26" size="2.54" layer="97" rot="MR180">USB-C Back Current Protection
Allows USB connection when 
board is externally powered.
(Max Vf = 400mV @ 2A)</text>
<wire x1="269.24" y1="381" x2="378.46" y2="381" width="0.1524" layer="97"/>
<text x="406.4" y="774.7" size="2.54" layer="97" align="top-left">Buffer to prevent back current on INT / RESET</text>
<text x="1394.46" y="365.76" size="2.54" layer="97" rot="MR180">Buffer added to prevent back current
</text>
<text x="406.4" y="835.66" size="2.54" layer="97" rot="MR180">Need a 40 pin FPC cable 0.5mm pitch  (A Type) cable to connect to the screen. </text>
<wire x1="510.54" y1="223.52" x2="510.54" y2="238.76" width="0.762" layer="97"/>
